<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/norms>
    a gmeow:Slice ;
    rdfs:label "norms"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "The norms slice of the GMEOW ontology (extension tier): GMEOW Norms Module. Anatomy, dependencies, and consumer are declared in this manifest; the manifest is the sole source of slice identity and tier."@x-gmeow-english ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/norms> ;
    dcterms:title "GMEOW Norms Module"@x-gmeow-english ;
    dcterms:creator "Blackcat Informatics® Inc." ;
    gmeow:sliceTier gmeow:tierExtension ;
    gmeow:sliceDependsOn
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/kernel> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/teleology> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/temporal> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/events> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/observations> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/standpoint> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/rights> ;
    gmeow:sliceConsumer "The lbox principia importer (EPIC #348: 4-tier authority hierarchy, special-directive triggers, paradigm precedence) and policy import/export (ODRL round-trip; OPA/Rego, Cedar, XACML down-projection — deferred to the compiler-arc window with the alignment set). The rubrics (#353) and registers (#355) extensions build on Norm and Condition."@x-gmeow-english .
